88	/// instances `entries_injection.dart` wires to share one real
89	/// `EntriesRepositoryImpl` -> `EntriesRemoteDataSource` -> `ApiClient` ->
90	/// `Dio` (both real interceptors attached) -> a real `entries` Hive box —
91	/// exactly how a capture cubit's `create()`/the badge's `retry()` reach
92	/// `MeusRegistrosCubit` in the running app.
93	///
94	/// This complements rather than duplicates existing coverage:
